# Local environment and private signing material. Share templates explicitly.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pfx
*.mobileprovision
*.provisionprofile

# Do not blanket-ignore *.log, *.gz, *.obj, *.sqlite*, or *.lock: this repository
# intentionally versions acceptance evidence, mesh fixtures, and dependency locks.
